#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are planning to use Executor for circuit execution, consider using the [generate_boxing_pass_manager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager) function from [Samplomatic](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic/) to create annotated boxes:\n"
